{"id":3369,"name":"Edens Zero","slug":"edens_zero","synopsis":"Eleven months after the grand finale of Fairy Tail, master mangaka Hiro Mashima is back with a great adventure beyond imagination! All the steadfast friendship, crazy fighting, and blue cats you've come to expect... IN SPACE!\n\nA young boy gazes up at the sky and sees a streaming bolt of light. The friendly, armor-clad being at his side tells him gently, \"That's a dragon.\" The fact that he's joking isn't important. What's important is the look of wonder on the boy's face... and the galaxy-spanning adventure that's about to take place! Join Hiro Mashima (Fairy Tail, Rave Master) once more as he takes to the stars for another thrilling saga!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\n\n*Note: The first two episodes received an online advance screening on March 29. Regular TV broadcast started on April 11, 2021.*","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2021,"createdAt":"2021-04-18 08:10:59","updatedAt":"2021-04-18 10:38:08","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":42192},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":119683},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":15597},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":43521},{"site":"ANN","externalId":23915},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":15154},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":81261630}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":7269,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/uGJOSqDNbQJeYPM1dhLuFMygXyHjaEqXFKBmJmLY.jpg"},{"id":7270,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/T5HYJJrNEJJQlYY8QbwHaOM7OKqETdp4JAYOhGqT.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":34,"name":"J.C.Staff","slug":"jcstaff"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":268,"name":"Edens Zero","slug":"edens_zero"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":10230,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":10231,"title":"Eden through the rough","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":11980,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":13848,"basename":"EdensZe